@startuml Sentinel_SOC_Architecture
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #080c14
skinparam defaultFontColor #f8fafc
skinparam ArrowColor #06b6d4
skinparam BoxPadding 10

actor "Client / Operator" as Client #06b6d4
boundary "Web Browser / UI" as UI #1e293b
control "FastAPI Gateway" as Gateway #0284c7
control "WebSocket Hub" as WSHub #0284c7
entity "File Ingestion Engine" as Ingest #334155
entity "Detection Engine" as Detect #e11d48
entity "Risk Scorer" as Risk #f59e0b
entity "Alert & Triage Manager" as Alerts #dc2626
database "SQLite / PostgreSQL" as DB #10b981
database "Isolated Storage" as Storage #64748b

Client -> UI : Select File & Destination
UI -> Gateway : POST /api/transfers/upload (Multipart)
Gateway -> Ingest : Validate Path & Compute SHA-256
Ingest -> Storage : Write payload (uploads/ or quarantine/)
Ingest -> Detect : Evaluate 7 Security Heuristics
Detect -> Risk : Aggregate Weights (0 - 100)
Risk -> Alerts : Check Alert Threshold (>30)
Alerts -> DB : Persist Incident & Audit Trail
Alerts -> WSHub : Broadcast ALERT_TRIGGERED
WSHub -> UI : Real-Time Event Push
Gateway --> UI : 201 Created (Transfer Metadata)

@enduml
